            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/CH0158_EventLogin_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Right. I expected you to come around this time."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "UIEventLobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_EventLogin_Season_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/CH0158_EventLogin_Season_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Things are going well, but not to a point where we can let our guard down."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "UIEventMission",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_EventMission_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/CH0158_EventMission_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "If you keep on poking me without saying anything...\n\n...I won't be able to understand."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "EventMission",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_EventMission_Day_End",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_eventmission_day_end",
            "LocalizeJP": "今日はこれで終了よ。\n……流石、といったところかしら？",
            "LocalizeEN": "That's all for today. …\"Just as expected\", should i say?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "CommonSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_CommonSkill",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_commonskill",
            "LocalizeEN": "AMAS, I'll leave this to you"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_ExSkill_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_exskill_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "I am watching everything"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_ExSkill_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_exskill_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "There is no exceptions. Not even you."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_ExSkill_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_exskill_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "Is there visuals?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_ExSkill_Level_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_exskill_level_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "You need this, correct?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_ExSkill_Level_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_exskill_level_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "This is your potential"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_ExSkill_Level_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_exskill_level_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "Please accept this"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_Growup_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_growup_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Seems like I've grown. Is there anything else?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_Growup_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_growup_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Pouring resources to where there is margin for growth. Rational choice, Sensei"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_Growup_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_growup_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "I see. You have expectations on me. Leave this to me. I'll show you results"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_Growup_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_growup_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "Um... I'm thankful, Sensei. I'm not sure if this is the right thing to say"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_Relationship_Up_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_relationship_up_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "When you are by my side, my pulse goes irregular. I wonder why that is"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_Relationship_Up_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_relationship_up_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Sensei, to say that you are the only variable that appeared in my life would be no exaggeration. That said, everything you do never fails to leave me restless."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_Relationship_Up_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_relationship_up_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "It is pointless to talk about the future. It's all a bundle of uncertainties. Is what I say, but when I look at you, I start to think of all sorts of possibilities"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20041,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Rio_Relationship_Up_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0158/ch0158_relationship_up_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "Sensei? I'm just practicing calling you like other students. Actually saying it is far more difficult than I imagine, it seems."
        }
    ]
}
